# Leave VITE_WORKBENCH_URL unset for the normal setup: the client calls same-origin /api/..., the
# Vite dev server proxies /api to http://127.0.0.1:8077 (run `python -m workbench serve --port 8077`),
# and in production whatever serves dist/ must reverse-proxy /api/* to the workbench, stripping /api.
#
# When set (here or in the shell), it is compiled into the bundle (src/lib/api.ts) and the browser
# calls this URL directly, cross-origin, bypassing the /api proxy. A value in this file does not change
# the proxy target (vite.config.ts reads process.env and does not call loadEnv).
# VITE_WORKBENCH_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8077
